### Elastiflix — inference endpoint setup
#
# Run these requests once per cluster before using the ELSER, E5, HYBRID or
# ELSER_JINA search modes. TITLE and BM25 need no inference endpoint.
#
# Paste the bodies into Kibana -> Dev Tools, or run this file directly from
# IntelliJ IDEA / VS Code after filling in the two variables below.
#
# README.md -> "Required inference endpoints" is the canonical documentation for
# this setup; keep the two in sync if you change anything here.

@host = https://localhost:9200
@apiKey = <your-base64-encoded-api-key>

### Sparse embeddings — required for Semantic (ELSER) and Hybrid
PUT {{host}}/_inference/sparse_embedding/elser
Authorization: ApiKey {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "service": "elasticsearch",
  "service_settings": {
    "model_id": ".elser-model-2",
    "num_allocations": 1,
    "num_threads": 1
  }
}

### Dense embeddings — required for Semantic (E5)
PUT {{host}}/_inference/text_embedding/e5
Authorization: ApiKey {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "service": "elasticsearch",
  "service_settings": {
    "model_id": ".multilingual-e5-small",
    "num_allocations": 1,
    "num_threads": 1
  }
}

### Reranking — required for ELSER + Jina rerank (ELSER_JINA)
#
# service "elastic" is the Elastic Inference Service: EIS holds the provider
# credentials, so no Jina API key goes in this request or in the application.
#
# The endpoint id below is what `elasticsearch.rerank.inference-id` defaults to.
# Alternatives, set via ELASTIC_RERANK_ID:
#   .jina-reranker-v3.5      preconfigured on EIS, nothing to create
#   .rerank-v1-elasticsearch Elastic's own cross-encoder, runs in-cluster
PUT {{host}}/_inference/rerank/eis-jina-reranker
Authorization: ApiKey {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "service": "elastic",
  "service_settings": {
    "model_id": "jina-reranker-v3.5"
  }
}

### Verify all three endpoints exist
GET {{host}}/_inference
Authorization: ApiKey {{apiKey}}

### Smoke-test the reranker on its own, before involving the search modes
POST {{host}}/_inference/rerank/eis-jina-reranker
Authorization: ApiKey {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "a caped vigilante fights crime at night",
  "input": [
    "A young Bruce Wayne becomes the protector of Gotham.",
    "A man with a low IQ recounts his extraordinary life.",
    "Two boys grow up in a violent Rio neighbourhood."
  ]
}
